---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Layout title="Download Equipnivo | Windows trial & getting started" description="Try Equipnivo with up to 10 active equipment items and unlimited staff. Windows download status, local network setup and first steps.">
<section class="wrap section"><p class="eyebrow">EQUIPNIVO / GETTING STARTED</p><h1 class="page-title">Your first ten items.<br />A proper workshop trial.</h1><p class="lead narrow">Test equipment maintenance software with your real people, real checks and real equipment before buying.</p><div class="download-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">WINDOWS / MAIN PC INSTALLATION</p><h2>{site.windowsDownload ? 'Download the Windows trial' : 'Windows download coming soon'}</h2><p>{site.windowsDownload ? `Stable release ${site.downloadVersion ?? ''}. Install on the PC that will host Equipnivo.` : 'A packaged Windows installer has not been published yet. There is no installer to download from this page at the moment.'}</p></div>{site.windowsDownload ? <a class="button primary" href={site.windowsDownload}>Download Trial ↓</a> : <span class="status-label">INSTALLER NOT YET AVAILABLE</span>}</div><div class="two-columns"><article><h2>What’s in the trial?</h2><ul class="ticks"><li>Maximum 10 active equipment items</li><li>Unlimited people and personal PINs</li><li>Unlimited checklist items</li><li>Unlimited maintenance schedules</li><li>Unlimited faults and completion history</li><li>Local network access for staff devices</li></ul><p>At the limit, your existing records remain usable. Activate a paid licence to add more equipment.</p></article><article><h2>Once the installer is available</h2><ol class="steps"><li>Install Equipnivo on your main Windows PC.</li><li>Create your first Admin name and personal PIN.</li><li>Add equipment and set up recurring maintenance and checklists.</li><li>Add Staff PINs from Settings.</li><li>Connect staff devices to the same Wi-Fi or LAN and open the main PC’s Equipnivo address in a browser.</li></ol><p>Keep the main PC on while staff use Equipnivo. Back up your local data regularly. Use a trusted local network rather than exposing Equipnivo directly to the internet.</p></article></div><div class="help-bar"><div><h3>Ready to unlock unlimited equipment?</h3><p>£79 once. Unlimited staff. All 1.x updates.</p></div><a class="button primary" href={site.checkout}>Buy Equipnivo · £79 ↗</a><a href="/licence-help/">Licence help →</a></div></section>
</Layout>
